  "description": "For four long years, Yun Sohyeon endured the humiliation of being neglected by her husband, King Yeongchin Mun Gukhyeon, the realm’s feared warlord. Left untouched while treated lower than his concubines, she assumed he despised her. But when Gukhyeon returns from war and demands her bed, Sohyeon braces for heartbreak. Instead, she is met with intense, long-suppressed passion from a husband who has secretly pined for her all along.\nSource: Lezhin",
